  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Combined projects of United Nations Humanitarian Air Services (UNHAS) and Logistics Cluster</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Logistics Cluster will provide a fleet of cargo helicopters which will result in an increase in quantity of humanitarian cargo moved through the common logistics services.  UNHAS will provide humanitarian air service that gives equal access to all humanitarian entities in South Sudan.</narrative>
  </description>
